  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> (linear first order differential equation)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8747;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;(I.F.=Integrating factor)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>;</mo></math><br />As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> as&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>function is not bounded in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
